WEBVTT

00:34:59.746 --> 00:35:03.663
also happens on the inside that, you know,
turns out for me, you know,

00:35:03.871 --> 00:35:08.579
the way to heal. Anything
is to keep going.

00:35:09.829 --> 00:35:14.454
And to keep going with humility and
faith and a sense of optimism,

00:35:14.454 --> 00:35:18.329
even when it looks and feels
really hard and, you know,

00:35:18.454 --> 00:35:22.746
I just I love this idea of the body
teaching us what what the soul and

00:35:22.746 --> 00:35:27.121
the spirit and the heart needs to know.
And that's what happens on a long walk.

00:35:27.871 --> 00:35:29.704
That's exactly what happens
on a long walk.

00:35:29.746 --> 00:35:33.913
I mean, I can't say enough what
a powerfully humbling